; H1M5_Gold_Risk025
; Gold (XAUUSD) H1 Order Blocks -> M5 CISD confirmation, trading ENABLED.
; Risk sizing at 0.25% of equity per trade.
;
; Measured 2023-10-01 to 2026-10-01 with fixed 0.01 lots:
;   +298.76 USD, 30 trades, 66.7% correct, profit factor 3.12, recovery 2.44, drawdown 122.54, longest losing run 3
;
; This pairing trades about ten times a year and wins about two thirds of them,
; with a 1:1 target. That is a different character from the M15 to M1 presets,
; which trade three times as often, win 44% and use a 1:2 target for roughly
; three times the profit.
;
; Thirty trades in three years is a small sample: treat the win rate as a
; direction, not a number you can rely on. Chosen as the best of 16
; configurations tested on this pairing, so expect less than the figures above.

